<td rowspan=2 width=40><br></td><td valign=top nowrap><font color="#669D6D"><b>Re: 調べるか・・・</b></font>　<b>セ－ラ</b> - <small>2002/02/19(Tue) 12:12</small> <font color="#669D6D"><small>No.283</small></font></td><td valign=top nowrap> &nbsp;  </td><td valign=top>
